{"config":{"lang":["en"],"separator":"[\\s\\-]+","pipeline":["stopWordFilter"],"fields":{"title":{"boost":1000.0},"text":{"boost":1.0},"tags":{"boost":1000000.0}}},"docs":[{"location":"","title":"savagecarol","text":"<p>Hi, I'm Kartikeya Sharma. I run a YouTube channel called savagecarol where I break down System Design concepts in a simple, practical, and interview-ready way. This website is the written companion to that channel \u2014 clean Markdown guides, no fluff.</p>"},{"location":"#the-irony","title":"The irony","text":"<p>I talk about large-scale distributed systems... but this entire site is a simple static site built with MkDocs and hosted on GitHub Pages. No microservices. No Kubernetes. Just Markdown. Sometimes simple is enough.</p>"},{"location":"#help-build-this","title":"Help build this","text":"<p>I need help writing Markdown guides on the system design topics I teach. If you contribute even one topic, you help thousands of developers learn. I will review and merge every contribution.</p>"},{"location":"#contribute-on-github","title":"Contribute on GitHub","text":""},{"location":"#links","title":"Links","text":"<p>\u25b6\ufe0f YouTube \u2014 watch the videos</p> <p>\ud83d\udc19 GitHub \u2014 contribute Markdown guides</p> <p>\ud83d\udcbc LinkedIn \u2014 connect with me</p>"},{"location":"1.system%20design/1.introduction/","title":"1.Introduction","text":""},{"location":"2.requirements/1.functional/","title":"1.Functional","text":""},{"location":"2.requirements/2.non-functional/","title":"2.Non Functional","text":""},{"location":"3.capacity%20estimation/1.definition%20and%20types/","title":"1.Definition And Types","text":""},{"location":"3.capacity%20estimation/2.thumb%20rules/","title":"2.Thumb Rules","text":""},{"location":"3.capacity%20estimation/3.calculations/","title":"3.Calculations","text":""},{"location":"3.capacity%20estimation/4.infra/","title":"4.Infra","text":""},{"location":"3.capacity%20estimation/5.calculation%2Binfra/","title":"5.Calc